{
  "_comment": [
    "Submit-record scenarios for the readiness oracle. Every label name here is",
    "invented on purpose: nothing in src/core/ may recognise a label by name, so",
    "these fixtures use names no real server would ship with.",
    "Per Gerrit's schema a label status is one of OK / NEED / MAY / REJECT /",
    "IMPOSSIBLE, and the overall record status is OK / NOT_READY / RULE_ERROR /",
    "CLOSED / FORCED."
  ],

